{"text":"[Reading 27 lines from start (total: 27 lines, 0 remaining)]\n\n\n\"\"\"\nVLM (Vision-Language Model) / Multimodal Worker\nGPT-4o, Gemini, Claude Vision - เข้าใจรูป+เสียง+วิดีโอพร้อมกัน\n\"\"\"\nclass VLMWorker:\n    def __init__(self):\n        print(\"👁️ VLM Worker - GPT-4o Vision - เข้าใจกราฟ+ข่าว+เสียงพร้อมกัน\")\n    \n    def analyze(self, chart_image, news_text, audio_transcript=None):\n        # Mock multimodal reasoning\n        chart_signal = \"Bullish engulfing + Volume spike\" if \"chart\" in str(chart_image) else \"Bearish\"\n        news_sentiment = \"Positive\" if \"ETF\" in news_text else \"Neutral\"\n        \n        combined = {\n            \"chart\": chart_signal,\n            \"news\": news_sentiment,\n            \"audio\": audio_transcript or \"No audio\",\n            \"fusion\": f\"Chart {chart_signal} + News {news_sentiment} = Strong Buy\" if news_sentiment==\"Positive\" else \"Hold\",\n            \"confidence\": 0.82 if news_sentiment==\"Positive\" else 0.58\n        }\n        print(f\"🔀 VLM Fusion: {combined['fusion']} - Confidence {combined['confidence']}\")\n        return combined\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    worker = VLMWorker()\n    worker.analyze(\"btc_chart.png\", \"BlackRock ETF inflow $500M\")\n\n[executed on device: 10_3_6_9 (85294689-03d5-431e-abd5-9e27d4c94814)]"}